Rebalance_parentToChild_CcipFork
├── given the active strategy is Base Aave V3
├── and TVL exists in the parent strategy
├── when CRE initiates rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should withdraw all TVL from Base Aave V3
├── and ParentVault should send the TVL to Arbitrum or Polygon through local CCIP
├── and ChildVault should deposit the TVL into Arbitrum or Polygon Aave V3
├── and ParentVault should keep the rebalance pending
├── when CRE completes rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should finalize the rebalance
├── and ParentVault should increment the rebalance nonce
└── and the active strategy should be Arbitrum or Polygon Aave V3
